    "title": "MI lawmakers not subject to state employee insider trading ban - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tim Skubick Shajaka Shelton ,\n6 hours ago\nLANSING, Mich. (WLNS) — While the Whitmer administration is reminding state employees using insider information to place bets on prediction markets is illegal, that same ban does not apply to state lawmakers.\n6 News spoke to House Speaker Matt Hall about the issue for the first time on Wednesday. See what he said in the player above.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WLNS 6 News.",
